# Multi-Input Hash Preimage — "I know (x, y) such that H(x, y) == z"
#
# Proves knowledge of multiple secrets whose combined hash matches
# a public value. Useful for commit-reveal schemes where the secret
# has multiple components (e.g., a value and a nonce).
#
# This demonstrates: multiple secret inputs, multi-argument hashing.

Secret Int Inputs: (x, y)
Public Int Inputs: (z)

compute: h = H(x, y)
check: z == h
